\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces PI control of the routing threshold $\tau $. The error between the latency budget $L^\star (t)$ and an EMA $\bar  {L}$ of the realized per-frame latency is fed through proportional ($k_p$) and integral ($k_i$) terms that nudge $\tau $; a lower $\tau $ sends more frames to the super path (higher latency) and vice versa, closing the loop so the realized latency tracks the budget.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
